              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukaneza hakuya kwakwihi nachisu chaluteŋi ludi nakubidima kesi, hakwila nindi, Enu aShadaraki, naMeshaki, naAbedinego, enu aŋamba jaNzambi Wabadika Mwiwulu, idikenumu, twayenu kunu. AShadaraki, naMeshaki, naAbedinego hiyakufuma mukachi kakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
