              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukaneza wahosheli nindi, Kisu kisu Nzambi yawaShadaraki, naMeshaki, naAbedinego, natemeshi kaŋelu kindi, napulwishi ambuŋindi amukuhwelela, anabalumuni izu damwanta, anahani nyijimba yawu, muŋa kwonti kwawu kupesha hela kudifukula kudi mukishi, chiŋa kudi Nzambi yawu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
