          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ami nashumu dehi lushimbi, nami, Antu amwacheŋi namwacheŋi ejima, ninyuza yawantu yejima, niakwamadimi acheŋi niacheŋi ejima, amba katenahu Nzambi yaShadaraki, naMeshaki, naAbedinego chatama, akayitetola ngwa, ngwa, kwayikunku hohu, nimatalawu akekala mazalelu. Muloŋa hikwekala mukishi watweshaŋa kupulwisha antu chochichuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
